=== plain-80: width 80, height 24, profile notty, dark, glyphs ascii, plain
# backup screen-off --------------------------------------------$
$
# Note$
# Mock: the Backup screen. web-01.example.net runs Debian 13.$
# hardn.yml says enableBackups: false. A change still backs up$
# what its rollback needs (plan §3.16). Each change is planned,$
# reviewed, confirmed y/N and applied on the real engine; then$
# the screen is read again.$
$
# Backup Settings ##############################################$
$
# Backup Configuration -----------------------------------------$
$
  [ ] Backup State         Disabled$
   -  Rollback backups are still taken$
  [+] Backup Path          /var/backups/hardn Not created yet$
$
  Select an option$
$
   1) Backup State         Turn backups on$
   2) Backup Path          Change backup path$
   3) Verify Directory     Check the path, writing nothing$
   4) Backup Runs          None yet$
$
   0) Return$
$
  > Enter selection [0-4 or q]:$
$
$

